print("DEMO: frozen-parameter associative in-context learning");
print("Scenario: keep the bias-only deployment vector [1,0,0] frozen, then let one and two labeled context examples contribute residuals to three held-out queries through an inspectable dot-product kernel.");
print("Native boundary: bounded dataset I/O, array/numeric primitives, and generic tagged JSON. MLPL work: baseline inference, context residuals, dot-product similarities, contribution composition, loss, fingerprints, budgets, and report validation.");
